    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but connection is just another temporary chemical reaction in the brain, right? we're just biological machines trying to distract ourselves from the fact that we're basically accidents in a void. it's hard to find \"nuance\" when the math just says everything ends in nothingness. it makes the struggle to stay motivated feel so fake.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
